  "notes": [
    "The reset is imBTC's _supportMarket: supply's write-after-transfer is only exploitable with a hook-bearing token listed. Later changes the exploit read (imBTC's rate model, the oracle swap, other listings) do not create the reentrancy.",
    "Campaign: the attacker's other 45 reentrant supply loops (tracing every imBTC transfer to or from MoneyMarket found no other sender re-entering) and its 21 transactions that withdrew and borrowed the other markets. ETH is Lendf.Me's WETH.",
    "imBTC and HBTC have no DefiLlama series and are valued at BTC, CHAI and USDx at their CoinGecko prices; the attacker returned everything, so there are no realised proceeds. The later return is not subtracted."
  ]
